<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Andrew Forms Migration</title>
<style>
  body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#1a1a1a;margin:72pt 72pt 72pt 72pt}
  h1{font-size:22pt;font-weight:bold;color:#1a3a6b;border-bottom:2pt solid #1a3a6b;padding-bottom:6pt;margin-bottom:4pt}
  h2{font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;color:#1a3a6b;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt}
  h3{font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;color:#2c5282;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:4pt}
  p{margin:4pt 0 8pt 0;line-height:1.5}
  .subtitle{font-size:10pt;color:#666;margin-bottom:16pt}
  .box-warn{border-left:4pt solid #d97706;background:#fffbeb;padding:10pt 14pt;margin:10pt 0}
  table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:8pt 0 14pt 0}
  th{background:#2d3748;color:white;font-size:10pt;padding:6pt 10pt;text-align:left}
  td{border:1pt solid #cbd5e0;padding:6pt 10pt;font-size:10pt;vertical-align:top}
  tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#f7fafc}
  .step-num{background:#2b6cb0;color:white;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;width:28pt;text-align:center;padding:8pt;vertical-align:top}
  .step-body{padding:8pt 12pt;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;vertical-align:top}
  .mono{font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;background:#edf2f7;padding:1pt 4pt}
  .path-old{color:#c53030;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5pt}
  .path-new{color:#276749;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5pt}
  .code-label{font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;color:#2d3748;background:#edf2f7;border:1pt solid #cbd5e0;border-bottom:none;padding:4pt 10pt;display:block}
  .code-block{font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:8.5pt;background:#1a202c;color:#e2e8f0;padding:12pt;margin:0 0 14pt 0;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;border:1pt solid #4a5568;line-height:1.5}
  hr{border:none;border-top:1pt solid #e2e8f0;margin:18pt 0}
</style></head>
<body>
<p class="subtitle">AEM as Cloud Service &nbsp;·&nbsp; Groovy Console</p>
<h1>Andrew Forms — Migration &amp; Cleanup</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Automated removal and reorganisation of legacy "andrew" folder hierarchy across SP Global BUs</p>
<hr>
<h2>1. Background &amp; Problem</h2>
<div class="box-warn"><p><strong>Problem:</strong> Multiple BUs had Adaptive Forms and DAM assets nested inside folders whose name contained <strong>"andrew"</strong>. These were legacy staging folders never cleaned up. Pages across SP Global referenced these paths directly — nearly <strong>100 page references</strong> needed updating.</p></div>
<hr>
<h2>2. Destination Paths Per BU</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>BU</th><th>Source (andrew path)</th><th>Destination</th><th>Name Change</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>corporate</b></td><td><span class="path-old">corporate/andrew-test-form</span></td><td><span class="path-new">corporate/test-form</span></td><td>Yes - stripped</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>mi</b></td><td><span class="path-old">mi/andrew-mi/[form]</span></td><td><span class="path-new">mi/forms/[form]</span></td><td>Yes - if prefixed</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>ratings</b></td><td><span class="path-old">ratings/en/forms/andrew-forms/[form]</span></td><td><span class="path-new">ratings/en/forms/[form]</span></td><td>Yes - if prefixed</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>energy</b></td><td><span class="path-old">energy/forms/andrew-ci-forms/[form]</span></td><td><span class="path-new">energy/forms/ci-forms/[form]</span></td><td>Yes - if prefixed</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>ci</b></td><td><span class="path-old">ci/forms/andrew-ci-forms/[form]</span></td><td><span class="path-new">ci/forms/ci-forms/[form]</span></td><td>Yes - if prefixed</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>sustainable1</b></td><td><span class="path-old">sustainable1/andrew-xxx/[form]</span></td><td><span class="path-new">sustainable1/en/forms/[form]</span></td><td>Yes - if prefixed</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Both <b>AF tree</b> (<span class="mono">/content/forms/af/spglobal/</span>) and <b>DAM tree</b> (<span class="mono">/content/dam/formsanddocuments/spglobal/</span>) are updated. Page refs scanned across all 5 BU page trees to catch cross-BU references. Intermediate folders auto-created if missing.</p>
<hr>
<h2>3. Migration Steps</h2>
<table>
  <tr><td class="step-num">1</td><td class="step-body"><h3>Discovery</h3><p>Walks AF + DAM trees per BU. Detects andrew folders vs. forms. Strips <span class="mono">andrew-</span> prefix from form names. Builds move map using BU-specific destination subfolders.</p></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="step-num">2</td><td class="step-body"><h3>Move Forms</h3><p>Auto-creates missing intermediate folders. Executes session.move(src, dst). Skips if destination already exists.</p></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="step-num">3</td><td class="step-body"><h3>Delete Empty Andrew Folders</h3><p>Removes andrew folders after all forms are moved out.</p></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="step-num">4</td><td class="step-body"><h3>Update Content References</h3><p>Manual JCR tree walk — no SQL2 query (avoids 100k traversal limit on AEM Cloud). Scans all 5 BU page trees. Rewrites formRef, formPath, guideContainerPath, fileReference for DAM paths only.</p></td></tr>
</table>
<hr>
<h2>4. Scripts</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Script</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Environment</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>remove-andrew-folders.groovy</b></td><td>Main migration — moves forms from andrew folders to correct BU subfolders, strips andrew- from names, updates refs</td><td>QA &amp; PROD</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>reorganise-andrew-forms.groovy</b></td><td>One-time dev fix — moves forms from BU root to correct subfolders</td><td>Dev only</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>validate-andrew-migration.groovy</b></td><td>Read-only QA check — no andrew nodes remain, no stale refs</td><td>After every migration run</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>audit-migrated-form-refs.groovy</b></td><td>Post-migration audit — shows pages referencing each of the 11 forms at new paths</td><td>Log / evidence</td></tr>
</table>
<hr>
<h2>5. QA Checklist</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Check</th><th>What</th><th>How</th></tr>
  <tr><td>No andrew folders</td><td>Zero nodes with "andrew" in name in AF or DAM trees</td><td>validate-andrew-migration.groovy</td></tr>
  <tr><td>~100 refs updated</td><td>Zero formRef/fileReference values contain "andrew" across all 5 BU page trees</td><td>validate-andrew-migration.groovy</td></tr>
  <tr><td>11 forms at new paths</td><td>Pages reference new correct paths — download log as evidence</td><td>audit-migrated-form-refs.groovy</td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>